  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into 1cm-thick wedges.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.\n• Roast for 15 minutes (it will finish roasting in step 4!).\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin, if preferred!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8261d6ec352636ca190dc/step-4967ca00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• In a medium saucepan, heat the butter over medium heat. Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add the water and a generous pinch of salt, then bring to the boil.\n• Add jasmine rice. Stir, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat.\n• Keep covered until rice is tender and water is absorbed, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam, so don't peek!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8261d6ec352636ca190dc/step-197bd310.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the rice is cooking, roughly chop Asian greens.\n• Trim baby broccoli.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8261d6ec352636ca190dc/step-dffe0720.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine the soy sauce and the honey.\n• Drizzle the roasted pumpkin with honey-soy mixture, then sprinkle with mixed sesame seeds.\n• Roast pumpkin until golden and tender, a further 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8261d6ec352636ca190dc/step-ef4d9730.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the pumpkin is finishing, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook baby broccoli until just tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add Asian greens, ginger paste and remaining garlic and cook, stirring, until greens are slightly wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Season, then remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8261d6ec352636ca190dc/step-49f45440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with ginger greens and honey-soy pumpkin, spooning over any sauce from the oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts. Drizzle with sesame dressing.\n• Tear over coriander leaves to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67d8261d6ec352636ca190dc/step-0eb84d50.jpg"
    }
  ]
